n of disputes, for the benefit of the Tasmanian community."]},industry:"Government - State (Government & Defence)",size:{description:"More than 10,000 employees"},website:{url:"https://www.justice.vic.gov.au/"}},reviewsSummary:{overallRating:{numberOfReviews:{value:86},value:3.4}},perksAndBenefits:[{title:"Flexible working"},{title:"Financial wellbeing"},{title:"Health & lifestyle"},{title:"Community"}]},companyTags:[{key:"Registration No.",value:"20153489G"},{key:"EA No.",value:"150-LB-090120-R"}],content:"<p>Global Industrial has been a leader in the industrial racking &amp; industrial supply industry for the last 40 years. We are currently seeking an experienced warehousing team member for a casual position at our latest Sydney warehouse based in our facility in Prestons, with a view to the position becoming permanent full time depending upon the applicant.</p>  <p> </p>  <p><strong>ESSENTIAL JOB FUNCTIONS</strong></p> <ul> <li>Daily liaison with Supervisor for jobs allocation and reporting</li> <li>Picking and packing of orders in a busy small team</li> <li>Accurate packaging of orders</li> <li>Assembly of product and some fabrication work</li> <li>A willingness to attend to general warehousing and house-keeping duties</li> <li>Experience in unloading shipping containers, however training will be provided to suitable applicants</li> <li>Proactive approach to OH&amp;S in the warehouse environment</li> <li>Other duties as required</li></ul> <p><strong>REQUIREMENTS</strong></p> <ul> <li>Previous warehousing experience</li> <li>Previous experience with racking and shelving systems would be an advantage.</li> <li>Attention to detail</li> <li>Ability to work under pressure and meet deadlines</li> <li>Current forklift license</li> <li>Mature outlook</li> <li>Excellent communication &amp; interpersonal skills</li> <li>Good time management skills</li> <li>Fresh ideas to help our organisations continued growth</li> <li>National police certificate</li> <li>Right to work in Australia</li></ul> <p> </p>  <p>This position's normal operating hours are Monday to Friday 8am to 4.30pm.</p>  <p>We offer a fun and challenging work environment with great teammates.</p>  <p>Suitably qualified and skilled candidates are encouraged to forward their resume and cover letter via the Apply for this job button below.</p>  <p>Applicants must have the legal right to work in Australia </p>  <p> </p>  <p>General Manager (Eastern States)</p><p>If you are interested in this new opportunity, please contact <strong>Amy Hatfield</strong> at Fuse Recruitment on <strong>test@example.com</strong> or <strong>0111 211 311</strong><strong> </strong>for a confidential discussion or apply now.</p>",contactMatches:[{type:"Email",value:"test@example.com",__typename:"ContactMatches"},{type:"Phone",value:"0111 211 311",__typename:"ContactMatches"}],sourcr:{image:"https://media.sourcr.com/seek/f11h67fxeq/amy-hatfield-1-21a296b091.jpeg",imageMobile:"https://media.sourcr.com/seek/f11h67fxeq/mobile-amy-hatfield-1-21a296b091.jpeg",link:"https://www.sourcr.com/recruiter/amy-hatfield-1?utm_source=Seek&utm_medium=978&utm_campaign=amy-hatfield-1"},gfjInfo:{location:{countryCode:"AU",country:"Australia",suburb:"Melbourne",region:"",state:"Victoria",postcode:"3000"},workTypes:{label:["PER_DIEM"]}},seoInfo:{normalisedRoleTitle:"Prison Officer",normalisedOrganisationName:"Department of Justice and Community Safety VIC",broaderLocationName:"Melbroune",workType:"242",classification:["6058","6008"],subClassification:["6075","6015"],where:"Melbourne VIC 3004"}},0x1c5fcd1:{sourceZone:"asia-6",topApplicantBadge:{label:"You may be a strong applicant",description:"Using data based on employers’ past behaviour, the default resumé in your profile and other factors, SEEK predicts you may be a strong applicant for this role."},advertiser:{id:"20918739",name:"Charterhouse Professional Support",searchParams:{advertiserid:0x13f31d3},isVerified:!1},classification:{id:"6251",description:"Administratio